| [workforceService.ts](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/workforce/services/workforceService.ts) | [createSettlement](file:///e:/TDC_App/TDGAMES_App/td-games-invoice-app/apps/workforce/services/workforceService.ts#107-149) now marks tasks `payment_status = 'paid'` |

### 3. Settlement Accumulation Logic

```
Eligible tasks = WHERE:
  worker_id = selected worker
  AND payment_status = 'unpaid'
  AND closed_date IS NOT NULL
  AND closed_date ≤ last day of selected period
```

Task closed tháng 2 mà chưa thanh toán → vẫn hiện khi chọn kỳ tháng 3 → cộng dồn đến khi paid.

